      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "抽油机井工况诊断业务问题",
          "html": "<p>一个采油厂有数千口抽油机井，示功图每日采集，人工逐井判读不现实；典型工况可靠，疑难工况（振动、结蜡干扰）判断一致性差。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"当前教学示功图\"><title>当前教学示功图</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M124 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-4.54</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M124 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">11.93</text><text x=\"259.25\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.75</text><path d=\"M124 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">28.39</text><text x=\"394.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><path d=\"M124 103.75000000000003H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"108.75000000000003\" text-anchor=\"end\">44.86</text><text x=\"529.75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.25</text><path d=\"M124 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">61.33</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#267d70\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,151.41931656966239 125.30253143517074,145.0223994916294 129.19758165092617,150.73399327240136 135.6476391844375,141.87209098968174 144.59058645569695,143.49840045350248 155.94029799376995,143.77892034179723 169.5874698721615,135.4453372692641 185.40067236537965,127.59423640972443 203.22761568903888,124.19784242257938 222.8966166337339,123.76376590988173 244.2182519681976,108.9068056744236 266.9871826885676,108.65207771986209 290.9841315452432,105.6926608963816 315.9779948026679,95.67584451156412 341.7280678946373,81.63465656771044 367.98636354085386,84.82236829637321 394.49999999999994,75.94503711274541 421.01363645914614,71.78913295481985 447.2719321053627,75.38522355889901 473.02200519733196,74.18452426229965 498.0158684547567,70.56153431895416 522.0128173114324,76.38403947374434 544.7817480318024,64.97766254896649 566.1033833662661,69.26655370911487 585.7723843109611,75.39664545439092 603.5993276346203,64.82758620689654 619.4125301278386,74.18480667870122 633.05970200623,70.66445552049854 644.409413544303,68.25752147646341 653.3523608155625,77.12277750702722 659.8024183490738,72.2375594414994 663.6974685648293,76.0033906345906 665,72.19555874758194 663.6974685648293,166.63770599590055 659.8024183490738,157.97526670638194 653.3523608155625,162.66941176998566 644.4094135443031,163.24754947666477 633.05970200623,164.97776940116222 619.4125301278386,161.95217767370912 603.5993276346203,165.59831953679202 585.7723843109611,157.85336561559603 566.1033833662661,158.76005847415814 544.7817480318024,167.54396310319896 522.0128173114324,159.47483184758187 498.0158684547569,155.52773653643627 473.02200519733213,158.79013343328523 447.2719321053628,161.47561013782445 421.0136364591461,165.46210745361464 394.50000000000006,158.6307164706459 367.986363540854,167.40883756827193 341.7280678946373,167.22499057621454 315.97799480266804,162.5732290071864 290.98413154524314,160.22476186677255 266.9871826885676,162.39564463401786 244.2182519681977,161.83039439346118 222.89661663373386,161.95995209014063 203.22761568903894,155.57689367795814 185.40067236537976,165.3099094853427 169.5874698721615,156.945912794258 155.94029799377003,164.40609993315752 144.590586455697,156.24894576720249 135.6476391844375,167.232398381134 129.1975816509262,155.9109222749713 125.30253143517074,157.4836966194876 124,164.95854737992642\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">光杆位移 / m</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">载荷 / kN</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>闭合曲线显示欠充满转折与漏失形态；特征散点解释分类依据。图是合成地面载荷形态，不能与真实井下泵卡等同。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "示功图特征与工况分类",
          "html": "<p>示功图把一个冲程内的光杆载荷和位移连成闭合曲线，供液不足会改变转折位置，漏失也会改变上下半程的载荷关系。AI将曲线压缩成归一化面积及两段平均载荷，从带工况标签的卡片学习三类质心，再按距离给新卡分组。这让采油技术员既能看到候选工况，也能回查决定分类的形态特征。</p><p>闭合卡片；横轴：光杆位移 / m；纵轴：载荷 / kN。</p><p>一次批量初筛可把每张卡的形态类别、归一化面积及邻近类别整理到同一份结果中，技术员把精力集中在异常卡和类别混淆上。案例用留井准确率与混淆矩阵检查供液不足和漏失的区分情况；当前卡片同时展示原曲线与特征位置，便于把模型判断和日常看卡经验对应起来，形成可追溯的复核记录。</p><p><b>默认教学演示在6口留出井的54张卡上比较同一分类任务：始终判为“充满较好”的基线判对18张，准确率33.33%；最近质心模型判对54张，准确率100%。</b></p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "井级卡片与工况标签",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点收集30—50口井的多时段示功卡，保留井号、采集时间、位移、载荷、冲程及对应生产状态，由技术员结合井史标注工况。同一口井的卡片应整体进入训练或评价分组，检查模型换井后的识别表现。本例以18口虚拟井、每井9张卡演示，12口用于计算质心，6口用于评价。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">示功图</span><span class=\"cl-s\">单井每日 1—24 幅，载荷—位移序列或灰度图</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">按工况分类标注 5 万—10 万幅</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">生产参数</span><span class=\"cl-s\">冲程、冲次、泵径、液量</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">辅助特征</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">作业验证</span><span class=\"cl-s\">检泵作业结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">提高标签可信度</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">逐井示功卡、冲程与人工工况标签</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/Terms/d/dynamometer_card.aspx\">SLB：示功图<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/common_pitfalls.html\">scikit-learn：数据泄漏<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "复合工况与标签一致性",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">复合故障形态重叠，人工工况标签口径需统一</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>主要难点是同一张卡可能叠加气体影响、供液不足和机械变化，现场标签也可能来自不同人员的经验判断。杆柱传递和冲程变化还会改变地面卡形，需要按井况统一采集与标注口径。最近质心是AI诊断流程中的可解释分类基线，可用类别间距离和错分卡片发现现有特征不足，明确需要补充的工况样本。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/cv\">图像分类<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/cv\">时序形态特征<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/cv\">类增量学习<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "抽油井示功图工况诊断",
      "lead": [
        "采油人员需要根据示功图形态提出工况候选，集中检查测试井上的混淆类型。 本例使用教学合成资料，案例规模与处理口径如下。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "教学井数",
          "18 口"
        ],
        [
          "每井示功卡",
          "9 张"
        ],
        [
          "训练 / 评价",
          "12 / 6 口井"
        ],
        [
          "评价示功卡",
          "54 张"
        ],
        [
          "固定类别准确率",
          "33.33 %"
        ],
        [
          "质心分类准确率",
          "100 %"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "虚拟井示功卡生成",
          "role": "数据",
          "do": "18虚拟井各9张卡，12井训练、6井测试。",
          "effect": "明确本例处理规模与资料分组：教学井数 18 口；每井示功卡 9 张；训练 / 评价 12 / 6 口井。"
        },
        {
          "name": "环面积与载荷特征",
          "role": "算法",
          "do": "计算归一化闭合面积及上下载荷均值。",
          "effect": "保留环面积与载荷特征的中间结果，供下一环节核对与比较。"
        },
        {
          "name": "最近质心分类",
          "role": "算法",
          "do": "仅按训练标签计算三类质心，欧氏距离分配类别。",
          "effect": "保留最近质心分类的中间结果，供下一环节核对与比较。"
        },
        {
          "name": "整井留出混淆评价",
          "role": "评价",
          "do": "按未训练井计准确率与混淆矩阵，交互卡仅探索。",
          "effect": "交付工况候选与留井混淆矩阵；回看卡形面积及载荷差异，结合井况复核。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "流程产出与评价口径",
        "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"案例业务流程，窄屏可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 780 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"虚拟井示功卡生成 → 环面积与载荷特征 → 最近质心分类 → 整井留出混淆评价\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:780px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title>案例业务流程</title><rect x=\"10\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f1eb\"/><text x=\"97\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">1 · 数据</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">虚拟井示功卡生成</text><path d=\"M184 76h16m-5-5 5 5-5 5\" stroke=\"#47695b\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e9edf7\"/><text x=\"287\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">2 · 算法</text><text x=\"287\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">环面积与载荷特征</text><path d=\"M374 76h16m-5-5 5 5-5 5\" stroke=\"#47695b\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"390\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f1eb\"/><text x=\"477\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">3 · 算法</text><text x=\"477\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">最近质心分类</text><path d=\"M564 76h16m-5-5 5 5-5 5\" stroke=\"#47695b\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"580\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e9edf7\"/><text x=\"667\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">4 · 评价</text><text x=\"667\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">整井留出混淆评价</text></svg></div><figcaption>每个环节对应下方的业务输入、计算操作及结果用途。</figcaption></figure><p>准确率=测试井卡片分类正确数/测试总数；归一化面积除以冲程×35kN，不受冲程量纲直接放大。</p><p><strong>成果交付：</strong>交付工况候选与留井混淆矩阵；回看卡形面积及载荷差异，结合井况复核。</p>"
      },
